---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Apply for Fall 2026
permalink: /register/index.html
description: Apply for the Fall 2026 Fight for Manhood cohort in Knoxville.
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ site.cohort.status }} Ã‚Â· {{ site.cohort.cost }}</span>
      <h1>Step into <span class="gold">the fight</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ site.cohort.name }} begins {{ site.cohort.startDate | isoDate }}. Ten weeks of brotherhood, responsibility, and growth in the light.</p>
      <p class="venue"><a href="{{ site.cohort.mapUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.cohort.venue }} Ã‚Â· {{ site.cohort.address1 }}, {{ site.cohort.cityStateZip }}</a></p>
    </header>

    <form class="form-card" action="/success/" method="POST" name="ffm-register" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="ffm-register">
      <input type="hidden" name="cohort" value="Fall 2026 Ã¢â‚¬â€ September 15 to November 17">
      <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>

      <div class="form-section">Core info</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="field"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="church">Church attended (if any)</label><input id="church" name="church" type="text"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="invited">Who invited you</label><input id="invited" name="invited" type="text"></div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="marital">Marital status</label>
          <select id="marital" name="marital" required>
            <option value="">SelectÃ¢â‚¬Â¦</option><option>Single</option><option>Married</option><option>Engaged</option><option>Divorced</option><option>Widowed</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-section">Family</div>
      <fieldset class="fieldset">
        <legend>Children (check all that apply)</legend>
        <div class="checkbox-list">
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="kids" value="Young Children"> Young children</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="kids" value="Teenagers"> Teenagers</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="kids" value="College Age"> College age</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="kids" value="Adult"> Adult children</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="kids" value="No Children"> No children</label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="form-section">Prior involvement</div>
      <fieldset class="fieldset">
        <legend>Fight for Manhood experience</legend>
        <div class="checkbox-list">
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="past_graduate" value="Yes"> Past graduate</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="attended_before" value="Yes"> Attended before</label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="form-section">Commitment</div>
      <fieldset class="fieldset">
        <legend>Confirm both commitments</legend>
        <div class="checkbox-list">
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="commitment_attendance" value="Yes" required> I understand this runs every Tuesday from September 15 through November 17, 2026, and I will prioritize attendance.</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="commitment_confidential" value="Yes" required> I understand this requires honesty and confidentiality. No stories leave the room.</label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="form-section">Notes</div>
      <div class="field"><label for="notes">Anything we should know? (optional)</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="Questions, schedule conflicts, or anything you want us to know."></textarea></div>

      <div class="form-note"><strong class="gold">What happens next:</strong> You will receive a confirmation after registering. Week 1 begins Tuesday, September 15 at {{ site.cohort.venue }}. Come ready. Come honest. Come all in.</div>
      <div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Step into the fight</button><p class="muted">Confidential. Men only. No cost. Registration is open for Fall 2026.</p><a href="/contact/">Questions first? Contact us.</a></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
